project_description:
exterior renovations including five (5) new windows with frames,
two (2) new doors with frames, masonry work including patching, reinforcement, and repair;
Interior renovations including full interior drywall work, tape, mud, sand to finish, commercial
grade exhaust fan and duct system installation, framing adjustments, painting, sealing, caulking;
electrical upgrades including installation of new panel, 240V outlet, rewiring and LED lighting;
plumbing work including install/upgrade plumbing lines, fixtures and drainage; HVAC work
including complete unit and ductwork, zoning and thermostat setup.
